"google_logo Play\nGames\nApps\nMovies & TV\nBooks\nKids\nGift Cards\nsearch\nhelp_outline\nBitLife - Life Simulator\nCandywriter, LLC\nContains adsIn-app purchases\n4.4\nstar\n1.32M reviews\n50M+\nDownloads\nInstall on Windows\nInstall on more devices\nShare\nplay_arrow\nTrailer\nGoogle Play Games on PC is required to install this game on Windows. By downloading the app and the game, you agree to the Google Terms of Service and Google Play Terms of Service. Learn more.\nAbout this game\narrow_forward\nHow will you live your BitLife?\n\nWill you become a successful millionaire, a loving parent, and a respected citizen? Or will you make reckless choices, start drama, break hearts, commit crimes, and create total chaos before you die?\n\nBitLife is a text-based life simulator where every choice shapes your story. Live an entire virtual life from birth to death in this addictive simulation game. Build relationships, chase careers, make risky decisions, and discover how your choices change your future.\n\nLooking for a life simulator where choices actually matter? In BitLife, every life is different. Become famous, fall in love, start a family, survive scandals, go to prison, build a fortune, or live a completely unpredictable life.\n\nYour choices create your story.\n\nLIVE YOUR OWN LIFE STORY:\n\nCreate a unique character and shape their destiny.\nMake choices that affect your relationships, career, health, happiness, and future.\nExperience love, marriage, family life, friendships, drama, and betrayal.\nBecome a doctor, actor, athlete, criminal, influencer, CEO, or anything in between.\nBuild your own virtual life story with endless roleplay possibilities.\nEvery year brings new opportunities, challenges, and unexpected consequences.\n\nTHE ULTIMATE LIFE SIMULATOR:\n\nPlay through a full virtual life from childhood to old age.\nA realistic text-based life simulator where every decision matters.\nBuild your dream life… or completely ruin it.\nDiscover thousands of random events, choices, and outcomes.\nNo two stories ever play out the same.\nOne life, you might become a famous millionaire. The next, you could end up broke and in prison.\nEvery playthrough creates a different story based on your decisions.\n\nMAKE GOOD OR BAD CHOICES:\n\nFollow the rules and become a model citizen.\nOr embrace chaos with crime, prison escapes, scams, robberies, and risky behavior.\nCheat on your partner, start fights, create scandals, or chase fame.\nDeal with realistic consequences based on the choices you make.\nYour decisions shape your reputation, relationships, and future.\nChoose a peaceful family life… or a chaotic unpredictable one.\n\nROLEPLAY ANY LIFE:\n\nLive rich, poor, famous, dangerous, romantic, or completely wild lives.\nExplore careers, education, dating, luxury lifestyles, and unexpected adventures.\nCreate funny, dramatic, wholesome, or chaotic stories.\nPlay your way in a sandbox life simulation full of possibilities.\nPerfect for players who enjoy life simulation games, interactive storytelling, and choice-based gameplay.\nBuild unlimited unique character stories with every new life.\n\nWHY PLAY BITLIFE?\n\nAddictive text-based gameplay.\nEndless replayability.\nInteractive story choices that truly matter.\nFree to play life simulator.\nA highly replayable virtual life simulator with player-driven storytelling.\n\nYour virtual life starts now.\n\nHow will YOU live your BitLife?\n\nJOIN OUR COMMUNITY:\nTikTok: @bitlifeapp\nX: @BitLifeApp\nInstagram: @bitlifeapp\nA super fun life simulator where YOU control what happens with your choices!\nUpdated on\nOct 31, 2026\nAvailable on\nAndroid, Windows*\nSimulation\nLife\nSingle player\nModern\nOffline\n*Powered by Intel® technology\nEvents & offers\nEnds in 23h\nPut that cookie down! The Schwarzenegger Challenge is now live.\nUpdate available\nThe streets are calling. Build your garage and race for the win.\nBegins in 1 day\nThe Maleficent Magician Challenge poofs in!\nData safety\narrow_forward\nSafety starts with understanding how developers collect and share your data. Data privacy and security practices may vary based on your use, region, and age. The developer provided this information and may update it over time.\nThis app may share these data types with third parties\nLocation, App info and performance, and Device or other IDs\nThis app may collect these data types\nApp info and performance and Device or other IDs\nData is encrypted in transit\nYou can request that data be deleted\nSee details\nRatings and reviews\narrow_forward\nRatings and reviews are verified\ninfo_outline\nphone_android\nPhone\nlaptop\nDesktop\ntablet_android\nTablet\n4.4\n1.19M reviews\n5\n4\n3\n2\n1\nRylie Pate\nmore_vert\nOctober 4, 2025\nREAD EVERYTHING. I LOVE THIS GAME. IT IS AMAZING. BUT. I noticed the large amount of ads recently. A few years back, you got ads for sometimes free lifestyles or jobs and few ads that popped up every once in a while. Now you get an ad barely being in the app. For me at least, when I watch an ad to get a choice or path, it will give me another immediately after giving me the reward. I age, go to do something else more in depth and boom another ad. There are ads around every corner :(\n772 people found this review helpful\nDid you find this helpful?\nYes\nNo\nEzra Krayenborg\nmore_vert\nSeptember 15, 2025\nI've been on bitlife for a long time. I have spent a considerable amount in bitlife as well for premium features. such as, no ads. Please tell me why you added the ad function to \"Spend Time With All\"? This is not a good move and would get me to stop supporting bitlife should you put more ads and continue ads on basic interactions through the app. I'd reconsider this move. I also noticed items are more expensive in the premium shop; some by a dollar, some by 3-4.\n355 people found this review helpful\nDid you find this helpful?\nYes\nNo\nMatt F\nmore_vert\nNovember 20, 2024\nFairly new to the game. The idea is fun, and the game can be entertaining... but... there are way too many random ads. Also, a fair amount of things are behind paywalls. It will be fun for a bit to explore various options, but I can see an uninstall in the future when there is nothing left for F2P to do.\n211 people found this review helpful\nDid you find this helpful?\nYes\nNo\nSee all reviews\nWhat’s new\nWhat’s up, Bitizens? This week, we’ve got a round of bug fixes and maintenance coming your way as we brew up our next content update. We’ll be dropping some info and updates on our socials, so check us out when you’ve got a chance. While you’re there, share your most chaotic BitLife moments from the last week…we love to see 'em!\nflag\nFlag as inappropriate\nMature 17+\nSexual Content, Drug Reference\nIn-Game Purchases\nLearn more\nPlay on PC\n\nPlay this game on your Windows PC with Google Play Games\n\nLearn more\n\nOfficial Google experience\n\nBigger screen\n\nLevel up with improved controls\n\nSeamless sync across devices*\n\nEarn Google Play Points\n\nMinimum requirements\n\nOS: Windows 10 (v2004)\nStorage: Solid state drive (SSD) with 10 GB of available storage space\nGraphics: IntelⓇ UHD Graphics 630 GPU or comparable\nProcessor: 4 CPU physical cores\nMemory: 8 GB of RAM\nWindows admin account\nHardware virtualization must be turned on\n\nTo learn more about these requirements, visit the Help Center\n\nIntel is a registered trademark of Intel Corporation or its subsidiaries. Windows is a trademark of the Microsoft group of companies.\n\n*Might not be available for this game\n\nApp support\nexpand_more\nSimilar games\narrow_forward\nIdle Guy: Life Simulator games\nHeatherglade Publishing\n4.5\nstar\nFrom Zero to Hero: Idle Life\nHeatherglade Publishing\n4.6\nstar\nLamar - Idle Vlogger\nCrazyLabs LTD\n4.3\nstar\nBusiness Empire: RichMan\nAAA Fun\n3.8\nstar\nVlogger Go Viral: Tuber Life\nTapps Games\n4.5\nstar\nIdle Office Tycoon- Money game\nWarrior Game\n4.7\nstar\nMore by Candywriter, LLC\narrow_forward\nBi